Tab Snooze (MINE) — personal fork

Where this code comes from
--------------------------

1. Tab Snooze (https://tabsnooze.com) — the original extension, by its
   original developer. Its source was never published and no license was
   ever granted for it, as far as this fork's maintainer could find.

2. Tab Snooze - Manifest V3, by csandapp — a continuation that kept the
   extension working after Chrome moved to Manifest V3.
     Chrome Web Store:
       https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/kgnigbfnfjgpfaiaafcbgdkpalapiinb
     Source code (public, no license file):
       https://github.com/csandapp/tab-snooze-extension-continued
   csandapp's listing credits the original developer of Tab Snooze.

3. This repository — an unofficial personal fork. It started from the
   built extension (v12.0.1) as installed from csandapp's Chrome Web Store
   listing, not from csandapp's GitHub source, and has been changed by
   hand-editing those built files since.

